><b>Especificaciones f\u00edsicas<\/b><\/li><li>Dimensiones (AlxAnxProf, mm)<\/li><li>162.3 x 79.0 x 8.6<\/li><li>Peso (g)<\/li><li>232<\/li><li><b>Bater\u00eda<\/b><\/li><li>Tiempo de uso de Internet (4G) (Horas)<\/li><li>Hasta 27<\/li><li>Tiempo de uso de Internet (Wi-Fi) (Horas)<\/li><li>Hasta 28<\/li><li>Tiempo de reproducci\u00f3n de V\u00eddeo (Horas, Wireless)<\/li><li>Hasta 30<\/li><li>Capacidad de bater\u00eda (mAh, t\u00edpico)<\/li><li>5000<\/li><li>Extra\u00edble<\/li><li>No<\/li><li>Tiempo de reproducci\u00f3n de Audio (Horas, Wireless)<\/li><li>Hasta 95<\/li><li><b>Audio y V\u00eddeo<\/b><\/li><li>Soporte est\u00e9reo<\/li><li>S\u00ed<\/li><li>Formatos de reproducci\u00f3n de V\u00eddeo<\/li><li>MP4, M4V, 3GP, 3G2, AVI, FLV, MKV, WEBM<\/li><li>Resoluci\u00f3n de reproducci\u00f3n de V\u00eddeo<\/li><li>UHD 8K (7680 x 4320) @60fps<\/li><li>Formatos de reproducci\u00f3n de Audio<\/li><li>MP3, M4A, 3GA, AAC, OGG, OGA, WAV, AMR, AWB, FLAC, MID, MIDI, XMF, MXMF, IMY, RTTTL, RTX, OTA, DFF, DSF, APE<\/li><li><b>Servicios y Aplicaciones<\/b><\/li><li>Compatibilidad Gear<\/li><li>Galaxy Buds2 Pro, Galaxy Buds Pro, Galaxy Buds Live, Galaxy Buds+, Galaxy Buds2, Galaxy Buds, Galaxy Buds FE, Galaxy Fit2, Galaxy Fit e, Galaxy Fit, Galaxy Watch6, Galaxy Watch5, Galaxy Watch4, Galaxy Watch3, Galaxy Watch, Galaxy Watch Active2, Galaxy Watch Active<\/li><li>Samsung DeX Support<\/li><li>S\u00ed<\/li><li>Bluetooth\u00ae Hearing Aid Support<\/li><li>Android Audio Streaming for Hearing Aid(ASHA)<\/li><li>SmartThings Support<\/li><li>S\u00ed<\/li><\/ul><p><\/p><\/div><br><\/p>                                            ","2":"","3":"","4":""},"description_short":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"meta_description":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"meta_keywords":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"meta_title":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"link_rewrite":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"visibility":"both","manufacturer_name":"SAMSUNG","supplier":null,"width":null,"height":null,"depth":null